"Require that JWT tokens are only introspected remotely.\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_OIDC__TENANT__TOKEN_REQUIRE_JWT_INTROSPECTION_ONLY+++[]\n"
"--"
msgstr ""

